  "vibe": "Ivory #f6f0e8 paper, deep plum #4a2438 floods and bronze #a86e3c hairlines — a bespoke-perfume atelier shot as a still, patient film. Gilda Display sets high-contrast serif titles over Albert Sans body. The backdrop is a working bench: three capped bottles in plum, bronze and blush, each with a highlight dot, while three scent trails curl 500px upward and dissolve; a fan of five blotter strips rocks ±3° with the centre one in blush; bronze droplets bob; and a bronze ring draws itself once per beat like a maceration timer. Titles drowse in across 46% of the beat and the camera barely moves — 0.3° of roll, four pixels of drift. Mechanics: a card that flips on its axis, a full circular dial, a caret typing a formula, and toasts sliding in from the side. Suits fragrance, skincare, fine jewellery, small-batch spirits.",
